   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A clear message in a few lines",
     "texto": [
      "A functional message usually includes who is writing, what has happened and what the other person should do. **Jeg blir forsinket** («I'm running late») explains the situation; **Kan du ringe meg tilbake?** («Can you call me back?») makes a direct, polite request.",
      "You normally place **ikke** after the conjugated verb in a main clause: **Jeg rekker ikke møtet** («I won't make the meeting»). To set a deadline, you can add **før klokka tre** («before three o'clock»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
